 "title": "How to Deal with People Who Cannot Be Reasoned With",
 "topic": "mindset",
 "summary": "The creator explains that when discussions turn into arguments with people who refuse logic, they are exhibiting 'monkey mentality' by resorting to aggression and insults instead of facts. The lesson is that you cannot reason with such individuals, so the best approach is to exit the conversation.",
 "key_points": [
  "When you use logic and facts in a discussion, but the other person ignores them, yells, or curses, they cannot be reasoned with.",
  "People who cannot be reasoned with have 'monkey mentality' and believe aggression and violence are the right responses to disagreements.",
  "The creator suggests that when dealing with aggressive or profane people, you should not do anything illegal like beating them, but instead exit the conversation.",
  "According to the creator, for people with monkey mentality, the only way to win is by using and showing more aggression.",
  "The creator's advice for the next time this happens to you is to tell them to fuck off and leave."
 ],
 "content": "Monkey Mentality :- How to deal with people who cannot be Reasoned with. How to deal with people who cannot be reasoned with? Suppose you are having a discussion with someone, but this discussion quickly turns into an argument where you are saying all the right things. You are using logic, you are using facts and every right thing possible. But the other person is just not listening to you. They don't care about facts, they don't care about the truth. Instead, they are yelling at you, they are cursing you. So, what do you do here? You need to show aggression. Because people who cannot be reasoned with have monkey mentality. Because whenever there is any disagreement, instead of being civil about it and talking it out, such people will use aggression and violence because they think this is the right thing to do. So if they are being aggressive, use more aggression. If they are using profanities, use more vile profanities. Now, I don't mean to say do something illegal like beat them or anything, but just make sure you exit the conversation because such people cannot be reasoned with. Because for people with monkey mentality, the only way you can win is by using and showing more aggression. That is it. So the next time something like this happens to you just say fuck off and leave. Text on screen: Monkey Mentality :- How to deal with people who cannot be Reasoned with.",
